.SH NAME
lumen - GNOME-like shell for Xfce and labwc
.SH SYNOPSIS
lumen [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A GNOME-style top bar, dock, app grid, and settings panel for XFCE (X11) and labwc (Wayland).
Written in pure Rust with zero crates and zero GUI libraries.
.SH OPTIONS
--overview:: Show workspace overview
--toggle-grid:: Toggle dock grid
--settings:: Open settings window
--lock:: Lock screen
--quit:: Quit lumen
.SH "Keyboard shortcuts"
Super+S:: Screenshot
Super+R:: Screen recording
Super+Y:: Toggle tiling
